  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Gleichung aus zwei Punkten bestimmen</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 12px;'>Zwei Punkte reichen, um die komplette Funktionsgleichung zu bestimmen &ndash; in drei Schritten.</p><div style='background:#1C1B1F;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:2;margin-bottom:12px;'><strong>Vorgehen:</strong><br>&#x2460;&nbsp;Steigung berechnen: m = (y&#x2082;&minus;y&#x2081;) : (x&#x2082;&minus;x&#x2081;)<br>&#x2461;&nbsp;Punkt P&#x2081;(x&#x2081;|y&#x2081;) einsetzen: y&#x2081; = m &middot; x&#x2081; + b &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; b ausrechnen (x&#x2081; und y&#x2081; sind die Koordinaten von P&#x2081;)<br>&#x2462;&nbsp;Gleichung aufschreiben: f(x) = m &middot; x + b</div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1.5px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;'><strong>Beispiel:</strong>&nbsp;P&#x2081;(0|2) und P&#x2082;(2|6)<br><span style='font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:2.2;display:block;'>&#x2460; m = (6&minus;2):(2&minus;0) = 4:2 = 2<br>&#x2461; P&#x2081;(0|2) einsetzen: 2 = 2&middot;0 + b &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; b = 2<br>&#x2462; f(x) = 2x + 2</span></div></div><div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgaben &ndash; Bestimme m und b</div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin:10px 0;'><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>a)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(0|3) und P&#x2082;(2|7)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='2' placeholder='?' style='width:56px;text-align:center;'></label><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;'>b&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='3' placeholder='?' style='width:56px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>b)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(1|3) und P&#x2082;(3|1)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='-1' placeholder='?' style='width:56px;text-align:center;'></label><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;'>b&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='4' placeholder='?' style='width:56px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>c)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(&minus;1|1) und P&#x2082;(3|5)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='1' placeholder='?' style='width:56px;text-align:center;'></label><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;'>b&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='2' placeholder='?' style='width:56px;text-align:center;'></label></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 8px;'>d)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>P&#x2081;(0|4) und P&#x2082;(3|&minus;2)</p><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>m&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='-2' placeholder='?' style='width:56px;text-align:center;'></label><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;'>b&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='4' placeholder='?' style='width:56px;text-align:center;'></label></div></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(6)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(6)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-6'></span></div></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-size:13px;line-height:2.4;font-family:monospace;'>a) m = (7&minus;3):(2&minus;0) = 2<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;P&#x2081;(0|3): 3 = 2&middot;0+b &rarr; b = 3 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; <strong>f(x) = 2x+3</strong><br>b) m = (1&minus;3):(3&minus;1) = &minus;1<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;P&#x2081;(1|3): 3 = &minus;1&middot;1+b &rarr; b = 4 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; <strong>f(x) = &minus;x+4</strong><br>c) m = (5&minus;1):(3&minus;(&minus;1)) = 1<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;P&#x2081;(&minus;1|1): 1 = 1&middot;(&minus;1)+b &rarr; b = 2 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; <strong>f(x) = x+2</strong><br>d) m = (&minus;2&minus;4):(3&minus;0) = &minus;2<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;P&#x2081;(0|4): 4 = &minus;2&middot;0+b &rarr; b = 4 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; <strong>f(x) = &minus;2x+4</strong></div>"
}
